   "staticUrl": "encore-mindseek-jobs-careers-5317948",
   "jobDescription": "<p><strong>Position: Technical Program Manager (TPM)</strong></p><br /><p><strong>Location: Bangalore, India</strong></p><br /><p><strong>Experience: 10+ years</strong></p><br /><br /><p><strong>Job Description:</strong></p><br /><p><strong>We are seeking an experienced Technical Program Manager (TPM) with a strong background in leading complex, cross-functional initiatives in fast-paced technology environments. The ideal candidate will have a proven ability to manage program lifecycles, drive technical roadmaps, and collaborate with engineering teams to deliver high-impact results. This individual will be responsible for aligning project execution with business goals, ensuring on-time and on-budget delivery, and managing communication across multiple stakeholders.</strong></p><p><strong>Key Responsibilities:</strong></p><p><strong>Lead and manage programs that span multiple cross-functional teams, ensuring alignment with strategic business objectives.</strong></p><p><strong>Collaborate closely with software engineering teams to define, build, and roll out technical solutions that meet customer needs.</strong></p><p><strong>Drive the development and execution of technical and product roadmaps.</strong></p><p><strong>Own and define program strategy, goals, milestones, and success metrics.</strong></p><p><strong>Build and evaluate system-level technical designs in partnership with engineering and architecture teams.</strong></p><p><strong>Establish and manage program scope, schedules, budgets, quality standards, and associated risks.</strong></p><p><strong>Facilitate effective communication and coordination between teams and stakeholders at all levels.</strong></p><p><strong>Implement processes to improve program execution and delivery efficiency.</strong></p><br /><p><strong>Basic Qualifications:</strong></p><p><strong>5+ years of experience in managing programs across cross-functional teams.</strong></p><p><strong>5+ years of experience in technical program management, working directly with software engineering teams.</strong></p><p><strong>Strong experience in system-level technical design and architecture reviews.</strong></p><p><strong>Demonstrated success in developing and executing technical and product roadmaps.</strong></p><p><strong>Experience with project management methodologies including risk, schedule, scope, and budget management.</strong></p><p><strong>Exceptional verbal and written communication skills.</strong></p><p><strong>Preferred Qualifications:</strong></p><p><strong>Experience defining KPIs and SLAs to measure performance and report progress to senior leadership.</strong></p><p><strong>Hands-on experience with AWS technologies and cloud-native development environments.</strong></p><p><strong>Strong organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple competing priorities in a dynamic, fast-paced setting.</strong></p><p><strong>Familiarity with tools such as Jira, Confluence, Asana, or similar project tracking platforms.</strong></p><p><strong>PMP, Agile, or Scrum certifications are a plus.</strong></p><p> </p><p>Interested candidates can share their updated CV to namrata.dutta@mindseek.net</p><br /><br /><p>Thanks & Regards</p><p>Namrata Dutta</p><br /><br />",
